@startuml
!include r4-sequence-style.puml
title FE-11 Staff or Manager Moderates and Replies
actor "Staff or Manager" as Actor
participant "<<view>>\n:ModerationPages" as Pages
participant "<<controller>>\n:ReviewModerationController" as Controller
participant "<<service>>\n:ReviewService" as Service
participant "<<repository>>\n:ReviewRepository" as Repo
participant "<<repository>>\n:ReviewModerationEventRepository" as EventRepo
participant "<<repository>>\n:ReviewReplyRepository" as ReplyRepo
participant "<<database>>\n:MySQL Database" as DB

Actor -> Pages : Submit moderation action
activate Pages
Pages -> Controller : PATCH visibility or POST/PATCH reply
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : authorize role and action
activate Service
alt Staff hides review
    Service -> Repo : set HIDDEN
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB : UPDATE review visibility
    DB --> Repo : hidden review
    Repo --> Service : hidden review
    deactivate Repo
else Manager removes or replies
    Service -> Repo : set REMOVED when requested
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB : UPDATE review visibility
    DB --> Repo : updated visibility
    Repo --> Service : updated visibility
    deactivate Repo
    Service -> ReplyRepo : create or edit current reply
    activate ReplyRepo
    ReplyRepo -> DB : UPSERT current reply
    DB --> ReplyRepo : current reply
    ReplyRepo --> Service : current reply
    deactivate ReplyRepo
end
Service -> EventRepo : append audit event
activate EventRepo
EventRepo -> DB : INSERT moderation event
DB --> EventRepo : audit recorded
EventRepo --> Service : audit recorded
deactivate EventRepo
Service --> Controller : moderation result
deactivate Service
Controller --> Pages : HTTP 200 / 403 / 409
deactivate Controller
Pages --> Actor : Display result
deactivate Pages
note over Actor,Pages
Admin has technical/audit access only.
end note
@enduml
